  m_Name: P5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::State
  storyText: "Last Delivery\n\nThe door slams open. A netrunner in a sweat-soaked cooling suit staggers in and collapses at your feet. She presses a warm data shard into your palm.\n\n\"NetWatch... don't let them... the Voodoo Boys...\" Her eyes go dark. Flatlined. The Tyger Claws stand up and look straight at you.\n\n1. Pocket the shard and run for the back door.\n2. Call Trauma Team!\n3. Hand the shard to the Tyger Claws."
